.TH "RAPTOR-GET" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-get \- Print the current value of each PATH. 'raptor help set\-paths' lists the grammar.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor get\fR [\-h] [\-f {text,json}] MODEL PATH [PATH ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the current value of each PATH. 'raptor help set\-paths' lists the grammar.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI{text|json}\fR

.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Print current values.
.RS
.nf
\fBraptor get pump.rbd system.runs 'block:Pump A.fail_params'\fR
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1), \fBraptor\-set\-paths\fR(7)
